Package: limnoqc
Title: Quality Control Tools for Limnological Monitoring Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Chris", "McBride", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "chris@limnotrack.com")
Description: Statistical and contextual quality control for profiler, buoy,
    and fixed-depth sensor data. Includes sensor drift detection and
    correction (pH, DO gain, offsets), service interval detection from
    multi-variable patterns, data coverage analysis, meteorological QC
    (barometric pressure, humidity, rainfall, solar radiation drift via
    clear-sky modelling), profile validation, outlier filtering, and
    stuck-sensor detection. Judgement-based functions that depend on
    time series context and site-specific knowledge.
